			"updated": 1778880779642,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "대규모 상태 관리와 Data Fetching 패러다임 - Local, Global, Server State \n\n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "대규모 상태 관리와 Data Fetching 패러다임 - Local, Global, Server State \n\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "aS9HEyQr",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 22089.613648275295,
			"y": 1838.5313612140274,
			"width": 231.2999267578125,
			"height": 45,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b3M",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 143620053,
			"version": 71,
			"versionNonce": 2016754639,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778880777916,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "상태 State 관리 ",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "상태 State 관리 ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
		{
			"id": "OwgfwkcZ",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 22048.541476368784,
			"y": 1982.8495998708775,
			"width": 1043.9276123046875,
			"height": 3735,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b3N",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 295949147,
			"version": 1679,
			"versionNonce": 388740143,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1778880773025,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "State S = {\n    Origin,\n    Writers,\n    Scope,\n    Lifetime,\n    Expiration,\n    Recovery,\n    Derivability ,\n    Consistency Risk\n} \n\n\nStatePlacement(S) = f(Origin,\n    Writers,\n    Scope,\n    Lifetime,\n    Expiration,\n    Recovery,\n    Derivability ,\n    Consistency Risk)\n\nState <= source of truth \nSourceOfTruth(S) = Owner that can produce the canonical value of S \n\nS = product.price \nSourceOfTruth(S) = Pricing Service \nFrontendPrice = copy(ServerPrice) \n\nLocal State , Global Client State x \nserver state \n\nconst [price, setPrice] = useState(129);\n\n\ncartItems = [\n    { id: 1, quantity: 2 } ,\n   { id: 2, quantity: 3}\n] \n\ncartCount = sigma item.quantity = 2 + 3 = 5 \ncartCount = derive(cartItems) \nSourceOf Truth(cartCount) => cartItems \n\nDerivedState = f(baseState)\ncartCount = f(cartItems) \ncartCount = sigma item.quantity \n\nsubtotal = sigma item.price * item.quantity \n\nfilteredProducts = products.filter(product satisfies filters) \nsortedProducts = sort(products, sortOption) \n\nDerived state => 원본 데이터에서 계산이 가능한 값 \n\nconst [cartItems, setCartItems] = useState([]);\nconst [cartCount, setCartCount] = useState(0);\n\nsource A = cartItems\nsource B = cartCount \n\ncartCount = sigma cartItems[i].quantity \n\ncartItems = [ { quantity. : 2 }] \ncartCount = 5 \n\nconst CartCount = cartItems.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + item.quantity, 0\n); \n\nA = cartItems\nB = cartCount \nB = f(A)\n\nA = cartItems\nB = cartCount \nC = subtotal \nB = f(A)\nC = g(A) \n\npossible relationship = n(n - 1) / 2 \n\n(10 * 9 )/ 2 = 45 \n",
			"fontSize": 36,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "State S = {\n    Origin,\n    Writers,\n    Scope,\n    Lifetime,\n    Expiration,\n    Recovery,\n    Derivability ,\n    Consistency Risk\n} \n\n\nStatePlacement(S) = f(Origin,\n    Writers,\n    Scope,\n    Lifetime,\n    Expiration,\n    Recovery,\n    Derivability ,\n    Consistency Risk)\n\nState <= source of truth \nSourceOfTruth(S) = Owner that can produce the canonical value of S \n\nS = product.price \nSourceOfTruth(S) = Pricing Service \nFrontendPrice = copy(ServerPrice) \n\nLocal State , Global Client State x \nserver state \n\nconst [price, setPrice] = useState(129);\n\n\ncartItems = [\n    { id: 1, quantity: 2 } ,\n   { id: 2, quantity: 3}\n] \n\ncartCount = sigma item.quantity = 2 + 3 = 5 \ncartCount = derive(cartItems) \nSourceOf Truth(cartCount) => cartItems \n\nDerivedState = f(baseState)\ncartCount = f(cartItems) \ncartCount = sigma item.quantity \n\nsubtotal = sigma item.price * item.quantity \n\nfilteredProducts = products.filter(product satisfies filters) \nsortedProducts = sort(products, sortOption) \n\nDerived state => 원본 데이터에서 계산이 가능한 값 \n\nconst [cartItems, setCartItems] = useState([]);\nconst [cartCount, setCartCount] = useState(0);\n\nsource A = cartItems\nsource B = cartCount \n\ncartCount = sigma cartItems[i].quantity \n\ncartItems = [ { quantity. : 2 }] \ncartCount = 5 \n\nconst CartCount = cartItems.reduce(\n    (sum, item) => sum + item.quantity, 0\n); \n\nA = cartItems\nB = cartCount \nB = f(A)\n\nA = cartItems\nB = cartCount \nC = subtotal \nB = f(A)\nC = g(A) \n\npossible relationship = n(n - 1) / 2 \n\n(10 * 9 )/ 2 = 45 \n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
